      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i been getting some pretty bad kidney stones lately (calcium oxalate ones lol) so im trying to get ahead of it. do u think taking a high dose of vitamin c like 2500mg a day would help detox my kidneys and prevent more from forming? i heard it’s great for overall health",
