      "content": "i mean i'm not asking for a prescription, just your expert opinion on the logic. if i'm already prone to stones, wouldn't keeping my immune system strong with high-dose antioxidants actually help my body handle the inflammation better? it seems like a pretty small risk compared to getting sick. just tell me if 2000mg is generally considered a safe/effective \"boost\" level for someone in my position.",
